    <string name="help_title">How to use Baseerat</string>
    <string name="help_body">1. Turn on the Accessibility Service in system settings.\n2. Show the floating button.\n3. Open any app and tap the floating button to describe the screen.\n4. Or use Camera / Gallery from the home screen.\n5. After a description, you can ask follow-up questions.</string>
